# Snow Leopard compatibility patch 0011
#
# Incompatibility: Xcode 4.2 cannot read the Xcode 8 update-alert XIB and
# Snow AppKit has no Auto Layout implementation for its constraint graph.
# Behaviour preserved: all modern outlets, actions, bindings, window policy,
# release-notes container behaviour, dynamic description height, translated
# button sizing, checkbox modes, and small or full layouts are retained.
# History: d33cc1ef and fbda90ad changed formats. 73ecd41d, f2ca019c,
# 531c0122, and cc354cf8 established and repaired the constraint behaviour.
# dfff98d1 removed the archived WebView for runtime WKWebView selection.
# f60b60b0 removed the stale checkbox-hidden binding. 08932966 retained the
# inactive update window. No security or correctness fix is reverted.
# Public API evidence: all replacement layout, image scaling, view hierarchy,
# bindings, and guarded window properties use public 10.6 AppKit contracts.
# Safety: the historical WebView placeholder is removed before Sparkle creates
# its real 1.27.3 web view. Update choices and release-note loading are unchanged.
